  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Rank gated instances, have a lot of support from the community and some critiques. The biggest critique is that visitors would be able to get into worlds, what we could do to combat this is make it that only age verified trusted users are able to make rank gated instances. Just like age-gated not every instance on a platform will become rank-gated, In fact like the current system majority will be open because when you age gate an instance you don't get a lot of people and usually the instance dies. But sometimes that's okay if you're willing to take that risk. If you make a world then you make it age Verified, and set the rank threshold to user or trusted only or everything above, You're very unlikely to get trolls especially if it's age + trusted it's very likely to be very civil. \n\nI heard arguments saying that visitors would feel alienated, however I believe a lot of people feel this way. If you want an instance that's open to absolutely everyone that's fine a lot of people don't mind and actually like meeting new visitors and everyone, people shouldn't have the choice to create instances with only higher ranks allowed in if that's the type of instance you want to run and be in. \n\nImagine a long day after work You want to make a public world, The last thing you want is to be surrounded and swarmed by \"hatefulnameslur 0986a\" with a soundboard. You don't want to have to moderate every single member coming in immediately. \n\nPut this behind a paywall something just give us the ability to do this, preferably make it so everyone can but if to combat it being overused then do what you have to do just give us this ability please. I've asked many people in multiple public worlds multiple friend groups a lot of people are for this idea.",
